cff-version: 1.2.0
title: Citation Validator
message: >-
  If you use this software or its datasets, please cite it using the
  metadata below.
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Edwards
    given-names: Michael Todd
    affiliation: Ohio Journal of School Mathematics
repository-code: 'https://github.com/OhioMathTeacher/citation-validator-app'
url: 'https://huggingface.co/spaces/ojsm/citation-validator'
abstract: >-
  A free, open citation validator. It checks each reference in a
  bibliography against public scholarly databases (CrossRef, OpenAlex,
  Semantic Scholar, arXiv) and reports whether the citation can be
  verified, without treating "I cannot verify this" as "this is fake."
  A deterministic pass resolves DOIs and compares the returned record
  against the citation as written; an optional AI second pass reviews
  only what the deterministic pass could not settle.
keywords:
  - citation hallucination
  - reference verification
  - scholarly publishing infrastructure
  - open tools
  - reproducibility
license: AGPL-3.0-or-later
version: 1.4.0
date-released: '2026-08-04'
